{"scope":"rt-2f91d9a314","css":".rt-2f91d9a314 p.MsoNormal, .rt-2f91d9a314 li.MsoNormal, .rt-2f91d9a314 div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-2f91d9a314 h3 {margin:0cm; text-align:center; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:14.0pt; font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif; font-style:italic;}\n.rt-2f91d9a314 h4 {margin:0cm; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;}\n.rt-2f91d9a314 div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657728;left:-52px;\r\ntop:18px;width:994px;height:20px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-style:normal'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/h3>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-style:normal'>DEPARTMENT OF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/u><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<div align=center>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0\r\n style='border-collapse:collapse'>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=120 colspan=2 valig